## 🔧 Mejoras Técnicas

### **Performance**
- [ ] **Code Splitting**: Lazy loading agresivo
- [ ] **Service Workers**: Caching inteligente
- [ ] **Image Optimization**: WebP, lazy load, placeholders
- [ ] **Bundle Size**: Reducir a <500KB inicial
- [ ] **Tree Shaking**: Eliminar código no usado
- [ ] **Preload/Prefetch**: Anticipar navegación
- [ ] **Virtual Scrolling**: Listas largas optimizadas

### **Testing**
- [ ] **Unit Tests**: Jest con >80% coverage
- [ ] **Integration Tests**: Testing Library
- [ ] **E2E Tests**: Playwright/Cypress
- [ ] **Visual Regression**: Percy/Chromatic
- [ ] **Performance Tests**: Lighthouse CI
- [ ] **Load Testing**: K6/Artillery

### **Code Quality**
- [ ] **TypeScript**: Migración completa a TS
- [ ] **Linting**: ESLint + Prettier strict
- [ ] **Git Hooks**: Husky con pre-commit
- [ ] **Conventional Commits**: Mensajes estandarizados
- [ ] **Documentation**: JSDoc completo
- [ ] **Storybook**: Component library

### **Accessibility**
- [ ] **WCAG 2.1 AAA**: Cumplimiento total
- [ ] **Screen Reader**: Optimizado para lectores
- [ ] **Keyboard Navigation**: 100% navegable por teclado
- [ ] **Color Contrast**: Ratios conformes
- [ ] **ARIA Labels**: Semántica completa
- [ ] **Focus Management**: Focus visible y lógico

